<section id="values" style="background: var(--surface)">
    <div class="wrap screen" style="display: grid; padding-top: 120px; padding-bottom: 120px">
      <div style="min-width: 0">
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 16px; text-align: center; padding-bottom: 64px"><span class="tag">Values</span><h2 class="d h2">What I believe in.</h2></div>
        <div class="vgrid">
          <div class="vcell"><span class="lbl" style="color: var(--accent-text); font-size: 12px; font-style: italic">01</span><h3 class="d" style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2">Seeking Jannah (Heaven)</h3><p class="muted" style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55">Faith in the Creator and the afterlife guides me. Remembering death keeps my priorities clear. “Every soul shall taste death.”</p></div>
          <div class="vcell"><span class="lbl" style="color: var(--accent-text); font-size: 12px; font-style: italic">02</span><h3 class="d" style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2">Workaholic</h3><p class="muted" style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55">Time disappears when I’m building something meaningful. Work is my flow state, especially when it makes an impact.</p></div>
          <div class="vcell"><span class="lbl" style="color: var(--accent-text); font-size: 12px; font-style: italic">03</span><h3 class="d" style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2">Minimalism</h3><p class="muted" style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55">Simple living, staying down to earth, and being present matter to me. So do quiet moments.</p></div>
          <div class="vcell"><span class="lbl" style="color: var(--accent-text); font-size: 12px; font-style: italic">04</span><h3 class="d" style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2">Active listener</h3><p class="muted" style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55">Listening to and sharing stories energize my soul. I mentor others weekly and learn from my own mentors and coaches.</p></div>
          <div class="vcell"><span class="lbl" style="color: var(--accent-text); font-size: 12px; font-style: italic">05</span><h3 class="d" style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2">Believe in connection</h3><p class="muted" style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55">My net worth is in the people in my phonebook.</p></div>
          <div class="vcell"><span class="lbl" style="color: var(--accent-text); font-size: 12px; font-style: italic">06</span><h3 class="d" style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2">Monk life</h3><p class="muted" style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55">Inside, I picture myself as a monk in white, with a bald head, quietly observing nature.</p></div>
          <div class="vcell"><span class="lbl" style="color: var(--accent-text); font-size: 12px; font-style: italic">07</span><h3 class="d" style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2">Growth mindset</h3><p class="muted" style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55">Life feels empty when I stop learning. Sometimes I wish I had a second brain to hold it all.</p></div>
          <div class="vcell"><span class="lbl" style="color: var(--accent-text); font-size: 12px; font-style: italic">08</span><h3 class="d" style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2">Guardian of my galaxy</h3><p class="muted" style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55">I have a son, a daughter, and an amazing family. They are my galaxy.</p></div>
          <div class="vcell"><span class="lbl" style="color: var(--accent-text); font-size: 12px; font-style: italic">09</span><h3 class="d" style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2">ENFP personality</h3><p class="muted" style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55">Search “ENFP.” You’ll get a good picture of me.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
